sentences.text:
It is clear from the record that several steps have been taken for winding up of the company; assets claims have been invited from creditors;
parts of the company's assets have been sold; all movable assets taken over by respondent no.4 SARFAESI Act have been sold; the immovable asset of the company is under acquisition; and the assets are insufficient to meet the company's liabilities.
15.

